 the ridged scroll wheel and layered internal micro-components; the camera glides slowly along the side as a sharp beam of warm orange light sweeps across the metallic textures, contrasting perfectly against the deep blue ambient glow.\nSHOT 3: Cut to a low-angle beauty shot: the mouse levitates weightlessly a few centimeters above the dark reflective surface, rotating in a slow, precise orbit; the duotone lighting flares gently along the glassy transparent edges before fading slowly into a sleek silhouette.\nAudio: deep pulsing sub-bass room tone, sharp tactile mechanical clicks, a sweeping glassy whoosh on cuts, and a rising electronic swell that resolves to near-silence on the final fade. ",1344,768,6,757358688076805,"minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors","qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors","minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors","minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors",false,"minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors",1,8]}],"links":[[194,105,0,92,0,"VIDEO"],[218,114,0,105,0,"IMAGE"],[228,119,0,120,0,"IMAGE"],[246,114,0,119,0,"IMAGE"],[247,120,0,105,3,"INT"],[248,120,1,105,4,"INT"],[249,127,0,128,1,"STRING"],[250,129,0,130,0,"CLIP"],[251,128,0,130,4,"STRING"],[252,130,0,131,0,"STRING"],[253,131,0,105,2,"STRING"],[254,132,0,128,0,"STRING"],[259,92,0,143,0,"VIDEO"],[260,143,0,144,0,"IMAGE"],[261,144,0,147,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":5,"title":"Use Image Size","bounding":[-1550,5540,340,410],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}}],"definitions":{"subgraphs":[{"id":"4c314f31-ecda-4b08-ae98-faaba1bf613f","version":1,"state":{"lastGroupId":6,"lastNodeId":147,"lastLinkId":261,"lastRerouteId":0},"revision":0,"config":{},"name":"Image to Video (MiniMax H3)","inputNode":{"id":-10,"bounding":[-2560,4790,171.62109375,348]},"outputNode":{"id":-20,"bounding":[2130,5070,128,68]},"inputs":[{"id":"d6eaa195-2266-4016-b7ed-b2d17a3e53c2","name":"first_frame","type":"IMAGE","linkIds":[195],"pos":[-2412.37890625,4814]},{"id":"03b95567-f496-4279-9d38-989dd